# CODEOWNERS for failure notification routing (issue #591)
# Owners listed here receive actionable failure notifications for the
# main and develop branch parity workflows. Keep this file aligned with
# the notification routing in .github/workflows so alerts reach the
# correct owner without duplication.

# Default owners for the repository
* @handsoff/maintainers

# CI / workflow definitions and failure routing
/.github/workflows/ @handsoff/ci-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS @handsoff/ci-owners

# Branch parity failure routing: main and develop share the same owner
# so a single notification per failure event is delivered.

# Pull-request merge regression detection (issue #594): the CI workflow
# routes regression failures to this owner. A single owner is listed so
# each regression event produces exactly one notification (no duplication).
/.github/workflows/ci.yml @handsoff/ci-owners
